# Xcode — scoped to app/ so the repo-root .gitignore stays a Python file.
#
# Note what is NOT ignored: xcshareddata/ is committed on purpose. The shared
# scheme carries the OASIS_SERVE_BIN environment variable the dev run needs
# (see README-dev.md), so it belongs in the repo.

## User state
xcuserdata/
*.xcuserstate
*.xcscmblueprint
*.xccheckout

## Build products
build/
DerivedData/
*.moved-aside
*.hmap
*.ipa
*.dSYM.zip
*.dSYM

## Swift Package Manager
.swiftpm/xcode/package.xcworkspace/contents.xcworkspacedata
.build/

## macOS
.DS_Store
